	<section_number>46.2-811</section_number>
	<catch_line>Coasting prohibited</catch_line>
	<text>
		The driver of any motor vehicle traveling on a downgrade on any highway shall not coast with the gears of the vehicle in neutral.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-218; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-200; 1989, c. 727.</history>
